| کاربران پلتفرم | `resources/views/admin/users/guide.blade.php` |
| مشتریان | `resources/views/admin/customers/guide.blade.php` |
| سایت‌ها | `resources/views/admin/sites/guide.blade.php` |
| فرم‌ها | `resources/views/admin/forms/guide.blade.php` |
| فیلدهای پروفایل | `resources/views/admin/profile-fields/guide.blade.php` |
| دسترسی و منو | `resources/views/admin/access/guide.blade.php` |
| تنظیمات کپچا | `resources/views/admin/captcha/guide.blade.php` |
| تنظیمات عمومی پلتفرم | `resources/views/admin/platform-settings/guide.blade.php` |
| صفحات ثابت و راهنما (لیست) | `resources/views/admin/pages/partials/pages-index-guide.blade.php` |
